      "jcr:created": "Wed Mar 20 2024 21:34:48 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><br>\n Design your OR with Stryker and</span> <br>\n <span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">see the difference.</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">We know the importance of OR design and workflow, and better yet, know how poor design can not only affect the clinical aspect of day to day operations but also your bottom line. Meta Quest 3 with ByDesign AR will streamline the planning phase, reduce the number of change orders, and will allow you to walk through your room or floor before the buildout begins.</span></span></p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Jul 17 2025 15:56:05 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
